+  unproved_assumptions: "none (axioms: propext, Quot.sound, Classical.choice)"
+  cap_finding: >
+    The cap step C(m+1) ≤ C(m) + g holds at Table 3 for every m ≥ 1 (tightest: C(3) − C(2) =
+    81/1250 < g = 82/1250) and fails at m = 0 (C(1) = 777/1250 > C(0) + g). Lemma 9.2 needs only
