+    the J_T integral bridge (cells by branch of U, the aggregate Dirichlet lemma, counting;
+    planned as V2e/V2f), the §9.3 rescaling, P⋆ and Theorem 11.1; no Gram entries of J_T are
+    computed.
+
+verification:
